# Push audience: all token users

When sending a home, motivational, marketing, or "tell people" push, the audience is **every user with a valid device token**.

Do not default to `food_discovery_audience` or the 6-person discovery societies (Phase-2 Tower H / Greenfield allowlist). That audience is only for the scheduled food-discovery cron slots.

Default dest for these blasts is `/` (home) unless the user names a different landing page.

Queue via `notification_queue` with `type=promotion` (respects promo prefs). Do not use `send-campaign` unless the user explicitly asks to bypass prefs.

Retry failed queue rows until processed. Do not treat a first-wave 6-device send as done.
